#: ../../03_ride-language/07_dapp-to-app-invocation.rst:149
msgid "The weight of the list is calculated as follows:"
msgstr "এই তালিকার ওজন গণনা করা হয়েছে এভাবে:"

#: ../../03_ride-language/07_dapp-to-app-invocation.rst:151
